00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.580
purposes.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.540
No president is perfect, but Joe Biden's first
100 days are actually looking pretty good.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:30.750
First and foremost, developing a top global
vaccination campaign after being handed trash

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:37.080
