00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:04.570
For those who care about the stock market,
as many claims to under Donald Trump, record

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:07.260
stock market highs under Joe Biden.

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.000
And it's been three months.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.530
OK, so right wing media is coming up with
fake scandals.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.240
I won't list all of the ones we've looked
at so far.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:21.150
You know, everything from the the relationship
between Joe and Joe Biden is fake to all these

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.830
different fake scandals.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.040
